{"id":"n89867-2-4","stage":1,"title":"올라가다 · 上京","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89867-2-4-1","ko":"자네, 언제쯤 서울에 오나?","zh":"你什么时候会来首尔啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자네,","meaning":"你","explanation":"자네：你","readings":[{"term":"자네","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70797","senseId":"1","lemma":"자네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제쯤","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서울에","meaning":"首尔","explanation":"서울：首尔；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"서울에","audio":"/audio/96e9693781c161f4a81f.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"오나?","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；나：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aa7a1b1564db7cda","term":"자네","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3","entryId":"70797","definition":"(敬语)听者为朋友或晚辈时用来指称听者。","pronunciation":["자네"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cbf82f5c39ca3ac1c746.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89867-2-4-2","ko":"네, 다음 주에는 올라갈 예정입니다.","zh":"嗯，我计划下周过去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주에는","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라갈","meaning":"上京，进京","explanation":"올라가다：上京，进京；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"2","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예정입니다.","meaning":"预定","explanation":"예정：预定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"예정","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66576","senseId":"1","lemma":"예정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上京，进京","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"从周边地区前往中央地区。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]},{"id":"8688e9ff7c84e0e4","term":"예정","zh":"预定","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3","entryId":"66576","definition":"提前定下或预想将来的事情。","pronunciation":["예ː정"]}],"audio":"/audio/16e1b493ed59bd1a5ca8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.378,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89867",